This repository contains two kinds of material under two different licences.

1. Code written by Edgegap: MIT License (below).
2. Content and code from Epic Games' Unreal Engine, including the Top Down
   template this sample is built from: Unreal Engine EULA, NOT MIT.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
1. Edgegap code (MIT)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Covers:
- MultiplayerGame/Source/MultiplayerGame/Edgegap*.h and Edgegap*.cpp
  (matchmaker client, EOS voice client/server/component/settings)
- Edgegap's additions to the template source files listed in section 2
  (for example the server self-stop in MultiplayerGameGameMode.cpp) and to the
  config files (the EdgegapMatchmakerSubsystem and EdgegapVoiceSettings
  sections in MultiplayerGame/Config/)
- Dockerfile, .dockerignore, MultiplayerGame/Dockerfile.unreal-containers,
  matchmaker-config.json and README.md

